{"id":"39.2.7.1","doc":"T","title":"Sampled Values","words":292,"blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":1,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"As described in "},{"t":"xref","id":"39.2.6.1","c":[{"t":"text","v":"section 39.2.6.1"}]},{"t":"text","v":", the sampled value of a measurement can be read from SENS_TOUCH_PAD"},{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"n"}]},{"t":"text","v":"_DATA."}]},{"n":2,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"However, the type of sampled value stored in SENS_TOUCH_PAD"},{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"n"}]},{"t":"text","v":"_DATA is dependent on the configuration of "},{"t":"field","v":"SENS_TOUCH_DATA_SEL"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]},{"n":3,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The following types of sampled values are supported:"}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":4,"c":[{"t":"b","c":[{"t":"text","v":"touch_raw_data"}]},{"t":"text","v":" is the value of the touch counter at the end of the measurement, and indicates the time taken (in RTC_SLOW_CLK cycles) to charge/discharge the touch pin a fixed number of times."}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":5,"c":[{"t":"b","c":[{"t":"text","v":"touch_smooth_data"}]},{"t":"text","v":" is generated by inputting a series of touch_raw_data values from a single "},{"t":"block","v":"touch sensor","id":"touch"},{"t":"text","v":" through an IIR filter (moving average). touch_smooth_data is less prone to noise spikes or outlier samples, thus is the value used for hardware touch detection."}]},{"n":6,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The IIR filter that generates touch_smooth_data is configured via "},{"t":"field","v":"RTC_CNTL_TOUCH_SMOOTH_LVL"},{"t":"text","v":" (see Table 39.2-2)."}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":7,"c":[{"t":"b","c":[{"t":"text","v":"benchmark"}]},{"t":"text","v":" is also generated from touch_raw_data values through an IIR filter."}]},{"n":8,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"However, the moving average window for benchmark is much wider."}]},{"n":9,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Thus, benchmark value is intended to represent the stable reading of a touch pin without the effect from a touch action."}]},{"n":10,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The IIR filter that generates benchmark is configured via "},{"t":"field","v":"RTC_CNTL_TOUCH_FILTER_MODE"},{"t":"text","v":" (see Table 39.2-3)."}]}]},{"t":"table","caption":"Table 39.2-2. Smooth Algorithm","head":[[{"t":"text","v":"RTC_CNTL_TOUCH_SMOOTH_LVL"}],[{"t":"text","v":"TYPE"}],[{"t":"text","v":"FORMULA"}]],"rows":[{"n":11,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"0"}],[{"t":"text","v":"-"}],[{"t":"text","v":"touch_raw_data"}]]},{"n":12,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"1"}],[{"t":"text","v":"IIR 1/2"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1/2 touch_raw_data + 1/2 touch_smooth_data"}]]},{"n":13,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"2"}],[{"t":"text","v":"IIR 1/4"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1/4 touch_raw_data + 3/4 touch_smooth_data"}]]},{"n":14,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"3"}],[{"t":"text","v":"IIR 1/8"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1/8 touch_raw_data + 7/8 touch_smooth_data"}]]}]},{"t":"table","caption":"Table 39.2-3. Benchmark Algorithm","head":[[{"t":"text","v":"RTC_CNTL_TOUCH_FILTER_MODE"}],[{"t":"text","v":"TYPE"}],[{"t":"text","v":"FORMULA"}]],"rows":[{"n":15,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"0"}],[{"t":"text","v":"IIR 1/2"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1/2 touch_raw_data + 1/2 benchmark"}]]},{"n":16,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"1"}],[{"t":"text","v":"IIR 1/4"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1/4 touch_raw_data + 3/4 benchmark"}]]},{"n":17,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"2"}],[{"t":"text","v":"IIR 1/8"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1/8 touch_raw_data + 7/8 benchmark"}]]},{"n":18,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"3"}],[{"t":"text","v":"IIR 1/16"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1/16 touch_raw_data + 15/16 benchmark"}]]},{"n":19,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"4"}],[{"t":"text","v":"IIR 1/32"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1/32 touch_raw_data + 31/32 benchmark"}]]},{"n":20,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"5"}],[{"t":"text","v":"IIR 1/64"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1/64 touch_raw_data + 63/64 benchmark"}]]},{"n":21,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"6"}],[{"t":"text","v":"IIR 1/128"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1/128 touch_raw_data + 127/128 benchmark"}]]},{"n":22,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"7"}],[{"t":"text","v":"JITTER"}],[{"t":"text","v":"touch_raw_data +/- "},{"t":"field","v":"RTC_CNTL_TOUCH_JITTER_STEP"}]]}]}]}